    [Test] Add A5 nightly GPQA-D coverage for Gemma 4 MXFP4 (#19053)
    
    ### What this PR does / why we need it?
    
    Add A5 nightly GPQA-D accuracy coverage for Gemma 4 MXFP4 models:
    - 31B: baseline 71.72%, tolerance ±5 percentage points.
    - 26B-A4B: baseline 70.71%, tolerance ±5 percentage points.
    
    ### Does this PR introduce _any_ user-facing change?
    
    No.
    
    ### How was this patch tested?
    
    Tested on A5. Accuracy meets expectations.
    
    - vLLM main:
    https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/commit/c4df37dfcc7f72ca41cd43801a468526ecf99a2b
    
